spans.s:
प्रत्य्-अभि-√ ज्ञा P. Ā. -जानाति, -जानीते, to recognize, remember, know, understand, MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to come to one's self, recover consciousness, Kathās. :
Caus. -ज्ञापयति, to recall to mind, Śaṃk.

प्रत्य्-अव-√ रुह् P. -रोहति, to come down again, descend from (abl.), alight upon (acc.), TS.; Br.; ĀśvŚr.;
to descend (from a seat, chariot &c.) in honour of (acc.), TS.; ŚBr.; MBh.;
to celebrate the festival called Pratyavarohaṇa, ŚāṅkhGṛ. :
Caus. -रोपयति॑, to bring down from, deprive of (abl. or instr.), MBh.

प्रत्य्-अव-√ स्था Ā. -तिष्ठते, to return, re-appear (with पुनर्), BhP.;
to resist, oppose, object to, Kap., Sch.;
to stand alone or separately, MW.;
to re-attain, recover, Bhaṭṭ. :
Caus. -स्थापयति, to cause to stand firm, encourage (with आत्मानम् ‘to collect one's self, recover’), Vikr.

(-अव-√ ईक्ष्) Ā. -अवेक्षते (ep. also P. ˚ति), to look at, ŚBr.;
to inspect, examine, look or inquire after, MBh.; R. &c.;
to consider, have regard for (acc.), R.

प्रत्य्-√ अह् (only pf. -आह), to say anything in the presence of (acc.), AV.;
to tell, relate (with acc. of pers. and thing), Hit.;
to answer, reply to (acc.), ŚBr.

प्रत्य्-आ-√ ख्या P. -ख्याति, to proclaim one by one, ŚBr.;
to refuse, repudiate, reject, ib. &c. &c.;
to deny, Daś.;
to refute, Śaṃk.;
to counteract (by remedies), Suśr. :
Desid. -चिख्यासति, to wish to refute, Śaṃk.

प्रत्य्-आ-√ दा Ā. -दत्ते, to receive back, MBh.;
to take back, revoke, ib.;
to draw forth from (abl.), BhP.;
to repeat, return, AV.; ŚāṅkhŚr.

प्रत्य्-आ-√ दिश् P. -दिशति, to enjoin, direct, advise, R.; BhP.;
to report, relate (with 2 acc.), MBh.;
to summon, Hit.;
to decline, reject, repel, MBh.; Kāv.

प्रत्य्-आ-√ नी P. Ā. -नयति, ˚ते (inf. -नयितुम्, R.), to lead or bring back, restore, Kauś.; R.; BhP.;
to recover, regain, Hariv.; BhP.;
to pour or fill up again, ŚBr.; Kauś. :
Desid. Ā. -निनीषते, to wish to bring back, try to rearrange or restore, MBh.

प्रत्य्-आ-√ वृत् Ā. -वर्तते, to turn against (acc.), RV.;
to return, come back, Kathās.; Hit. &c.:
Caus. -वर्तयति, to drive back, repel, RV.; ŚBr.

प्रत्य्-आ-√ हृ P. -हरति, to draw in or back, ŚāṅkhŚr.; MBh. &c.;
to withdraw (the senses from worldly objects), Pur.;
to replace, fetch or bring back, recover, ŚrS.; MBh.; Kāv. &c.;
to rearrange, restore, R.;
to take up again, continue (a business, sacrifice &c.), MBh.; Hariv.;
to report, relate, MBh.;
to utter (a speech), cry, MW.;
to withdraw (what has been created), destroy, Hariv.; Pur.;
 w.r. for प्र-व्या-हृ, MBh. &c.

प्रत्य्-उद्-√ गम् P. -गच्छति (ep. also Ā. ˚ते), to go out towards, advance to meet (a friend or an enemy), Mn.; MBh. &c.;
to come forth again, Prasannar.;
to set out for (acc. or loc.), Kāraṇḍ.

प्रत्य्-उप-√ विश् P. -विशति, to sit down opposite to or before (acc.);
to beset or besiege a person (to make him yield), MBh.; R. :
Caus. -वेशयते, to cause a person to beset or besiege another, Āpast.;
to oppose, resist, R.

प्रत्य्-उप-√ स्था P. Ā. तिष्ठति, ˚ते, (Ā.) to stand opposite to, ŚBr.;
 (Ā.) to wait on MBh. ;
 (P.) to insist on (loc.), Vajracch. :
Caus. -स्थापयति, to call forth, manifest, Śaṃk.

प्रत्य्-√ ऊह् P. Ā. -ऊहति, ˚ते (ind.p. -उह्य, Naiṣ.), to push back, strip off, RV.; ŚBr.; ŚrS.;
to bring back, recover, BhP.;
to ward off, keep away, AV.; ŚBr.; ChUp.;
to interrupt, Mn.; Naiṣ.;
to offer, present, ŚBr.

प्रत्य्-√ ऋ Caus. -अर्पयति, to cause to go towards, throw towards, AV.;
to fasten, fix, put on ŚBr.; Ragh.;
to render up, deliver back, restore, return, Mṛcch.; Kālid.;
to give again or anew, Kathās.
